Spec: Public manifest parser

Purpose:
  Expose validated declarations with deterministic policy defaults and no parsing side effects.

Owns:
  ./ManifestContract.cs
  @LinkGate.Contracts.ManifestContract

References:
  /docs/adr/0001-public-contract-normalization.md
  /contracts/vectors/cases.json

Must:
  @ManifestContract.Parse and @ManifestContract.NormalizePolicy enforce the accepted normalization ADR.
  Reject invalid encoding, ambiguous JSON, unknown fields and inconsistent declaration values before constructing public models.
  Return @ContractException without input reflection on every input rejection.
  Share the same internal strict document reader with @ConnectionOpenRequest rather than accepting a second weaker JSON interpretation.

Must not:
  Read credentials, open sockets or modify platform configuration.

Exposes:
  @ManifestContract.Parse
  @ManifestContract.NormalizePolicy

Done when:
  Accepted and rejected shared cases match their explicit expected results.
